OL,3,GNEWSAThick fog disrupts morning travel
OL,4,Aas yellow weather warnings in effect
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe larger warning covers an area of
OL,7,FEngland and Wales stretching from
OL,8,FCanterbury to Cardiff, Hull to St Asaph
OL,9,Fand Southampton to York, and includes
OL,10,FLondon, Birmingham and parts of Greater
OL,11,FManchester.
OL,13,FVisibility could fall to less than 50m
OL,14,Fin places, making driving difficult.
OL,15,FBus, train, ferry and flight services
OL,16,Fcould also face delays or
OL,17,Fcancellations.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
